{"version":1,"content":"<p>《2026香港小姐競選》佳麗盧蔚晴在參選期間及決賽上兩度表演做DJ打碟，令人留下深刻印象，雖然她最終未能當選，但似乎誤打誤撞之間找到新出路！</p><p>事關她對打碟產生了濃厚興趣，還拉埋從參選起就非常老友的另一佳麗魏欣一起在蘭桂坊出道做DJ！</p><p>&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T09:23:59.564035+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T09:02:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T09:17:18.361298+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T09:17:18.361298+00:00","content_hash":"61ea941b170cf9277e3c5f3c487b8707084c9b550b69a06c263141365c57d35f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}